2.2.4.3 Wayﬁnding

Wayﬁnding is the cognitive process of learning and understanding a path through an environment [31]. The wayﬁnding task is to know how to get from a starting point to a desired destination. This concept is discussed in relationship to techniques regarding ADAS systems and IVIS, because both areas of application construct different environments for route planning.

Environmental Paths

